.\" excerpt: systemd systemctl(1), Debian trixie; header lacks Generator
.TH SYSTEMCTL 1
.SH NAME
systemctl \- control the system and service manager
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
.B -t , --type=
.RS 4
List units of the specified types.
.PP
.B service
.RS 4
A unit type, not an option.
.RE
.PP
.B -1
.RS 4
An argument example, not a top-level flag.
.RE
.RE
.PP
.B --state=
.RS 4
Show units in the specified states.
.RE
.PP
.B --help
.RS 4
Print help.
.RE
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.B list-units
.RS 4
A command name, not a flag.
.RE
.PP
.B --version
.RS 4
Print the version.
.RE
